{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45427","headline":"安国寺随驾幸兴唐观应制 · 广宣","name":"安国寺随驾幸兴唐观应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东林何殿是西邻，禅客垣墙接羽人。\n万乘游仙宗有道，三车引路本无尘。\n初传宝诀长生术，已证金刚不坏身。\n两地尽修天上事，共瞻銮驾重来巡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"广宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}